  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11588 introduces the concept of [sensitive information](https://whatpr.org/html/11588/canvas.html#exposing-sensitive-information) to explain what does and does not get drawn with `drawElementImage()`. The same issues appear when drawing an SVG image using `<foreignObject>` with arbitrary HTML inside, and browsers already have special behavior for this.\n\nThis issue tracks applying the sensitive information concept to `<foreignObject>` as well, and getting interoperability on that.",
